  "labelNotes": "Supply range 4.5-18 V is printed in both Recommended Operating Conditions (p3) and Electrical Characteristics (p4); labelled once from ROC. IQ/ISHDN conditions (VFB = 0.9V, VEN = 0V) are not allowed keys, so omitted. Excluded: IFB Feedback Bias Current (analog sense-pin bias) and ILEAK Switch Leakage Current (switch/output leakage, not a supply or input-pin current). Abs max: only VIN 20 V labelled; VEN and VBS are expressions; VSW 21 V (switch output node) and VFB 6 V (feedback pin) judged not supply/input-voltage rows - a reviewer may want VFB 6 V included."
